liboqs
------------------------------------------
C library for prototyping and experimenting with quantum-resistant cryptography

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  liboqs-devel-0.16.0-1bl1
  liboqs9-0.16.0-1bl1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  python3-pytest-9.1.1-1
  python3-requests-2.34.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/open-quantum-safe/liboqs

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/open-quantum-safe/liboqs/archive/refs/tags/0.16.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack liboqs-0.16.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./liboqs-0.16.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/liboqs-0.16.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liboqs-0.16.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liboqs9-0.16.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liboqs-devel-0.16.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

